+- Web：<http://127.0.0.1:3000/trips>
+- 杭州演示：<http://127.0.0.1:3000/demo>
+- API：<http://127.0.0.1:8000>
+- OpenAPI：<http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs>
+
+汇报前的完整启动、演示顺序和异常预案见 [演示手册](docs/DEMO_RUNBOOK.md)。
+- PostgreSQL：`127.0.0.1:54329`
