+Agent v1 covers deterministic context parsing, structured semantic extraction,
+database entity grounding, risk/workflow routing, bounded clarification, itinerary drafting,
+route enrichment, deterministic validation, one correction attempt, candidate
+revision persistence, and explicit approval or rejection.
+
+The Agent produces a reviewable `PlanRevision`; it never writes a formal trip
+directly. Formal `Activity` and `RouteLeg` rows are changed only by the
+transactional revision-acceptance service after deterministic validation and an
+explicit user decision.
+
+Agent v1 is a local, single-user development baseline. Authentication and tenant
+authorization are not implemented. The API must not be exposed as a public or
+multi-user service until those boundaries are added and tested.
